silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_10_commuting_factorization_conditions_concrete_anchor#trace silm:hasLongDescription "The Trace is the Mittens domestic-cat classification leg (DomesticCat) as a typed source-leg arrow that anchors BY Mittens, not as an identity. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{Trace}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
